      "text": "VISUAL DIRECTION: Calm Finance (Clarity for money)\nColor strategy: Committed: one deep trustworthy color for the hero module, light neutral app ground, one fresh accent for growth and actions\nTypography: Balances at 40–56px in tabular numerals with a smaller raised currency symbol and lighter decimals; amounts right-aligned in lists; positive values with a sign; spending in normal ink, not red.\nColor: A deep base (graphite, forest or ink navy) for one balance module with inverse text, a light neutral app background, and one fresh accent (lime, mint or saffron) for growth and primary actions. Red only for real alerts.\nLayout and composition: One hero number module, a row of quick actions, then a ledger grouped by day. Insights use one chart with a takeaway sentence above it.\nComponents: Balance module, circular quick actions with labels, ledger rows (logo tile, merchant, category, amount), segmented time ranges, one clean chart with a highlighted bar.\nImagery: Merchant logos as letter tiles; little else.\nMotion: Reassuring: number count-ups, 500ms chart draws, no surprises.\nSignature moves to choose from: A deep-colored balance module with a raised currency symbol; A ledger grouped by day; A chart with a one-sentence insight.\nNever: No crypto neon; No red for normal spending; No six-chart dashboards; No mascots.\nThe cliché rendition to avoid: Purple gradient credit-card graphics and glowing charts."
